195 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E ( Hello! I am Ishwari Jangam, a naturally curious individual with a constant desire to explore new things. Travelling is one of my passions it pushes me out of my comfort zone and allows me to collect joyful memories. Each journey enriches my life and broadens my perspective. I hail from Pune city. In addition to design, I have various hobbies that I enjoy, such as dancing, Painting allows me to express my emotions on a canvas. Crocheting has a therapeutic effect on me, and I also love immersing myself in crime podcasts. Photography helps me capture the beauty around me. Each of these hobbies reflects a different aspect of my personality and fuels my creativity.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [2]
>>
